  "notes": "Compatible patch release carrying the accepted server-side owner-gated Admin authority foundation for issue #351. The bootstrap-managed identity becomes a nonassignable platform owner; owner-only additive-v2 routes grant and revoke Admin authority for active existing accounts and create player-only accounts; transaction-scoped invariants preserve the last owner and last Admin; affected privilege sessions are revoked; and actor-attributed audit events record accepted changes. Frozen v1 behavior is unchanged, and issue #351 remains open for the Administrators-area UI, recent-reauth, idempotency, session, audit, MySQL, browser, and compatibility remainder. The exact immutable v0.9.5.19 release remains the application-only predecessor, MySQL schema 2 remains exact, database rollback is prohibited, and provider changes, DNS, billing, public signup, live OAuth, mail activation, invitation, unrestricted public exposure, credential rotation, and SSH ingress changes remain separately gated."
